  "elements": [
    {
      "id": "FmJn97530Xmc65WGu9PM3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -903.539637348593,
      "y": 2681.2772132589726,
      "width": 645.9331025566255,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2094326222,
      "version": 618,
      "versionNonce": 10150970,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786352637518,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.Functional Requirement\n   - User should be able to search a event based on some title , location and date \n  Ex- Movie \n- user should be able to view the details of the events ( seat ,description , metadata) \n- user must be able to book the event",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.Functional Requirement\n   - User should be able to search a event based on some title , location and date \n  Ex- Movie \n- user should be able to view the details of the events ( seat ,description , metadata) \n- user must be able to book the event",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VQFQ6Bi_Nwgot5H9sNbTc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -994.7115376463915,
      "y": 2401.7476086813967,
      "width": 1118.628173828125,
      "height": 45,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a6",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1108125202,
      "version": 494,
      "versionNonce": 769021434,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786355393763,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Design a Ticket Booking Service like Book My show, Paytem , District",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design a Ticket Booking Service like Book My show, Paytem , District",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "9MJbqVFeujTc8gdYM0yph",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -72.1603024524045,
      "y": 2814.135191138149,
      "width": 983.1768970992443,
      "height": 531.4451234961588,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 127485010,
      "version": 3667,
      "versionNonce": 1638185382,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786352680910,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Non functionl requirements\n     -  CAP theorem : \n          - Consistency while Booking the ticket seat, payment etc  \n             Ex- Same seat cannot be booked by multiple user.\n          - Available for Search, View the events. \n\n       - Back of the envelop assumptions\n            1. DAU - 100 M\n            2. 1% of DAU book per day- 1 M \n            3.  Read Actions Per User(searching, viewing) - 10 \n            4.  Seat Lock :  5 Mins\n            5.  Peak factor: 10x avg \n            6.  QPS: \n                  - read : 100M users* 10 actions =  1 B read per day = 1B/10^5 seconds =  10K qps\n                                Peak 10x average read=  100Kqps\n                   - write: 1M /Day = 10QPS \n                                 Peak 10x average=  100QPS\n                    there for  read:write=  1000:1 \n             7. Storage :\n                   =  1M* booking table(1000 bytes)  = 1M*1000 bytes /day\n                    = 365 * 10^6 *10^3 bytes peryear = 365GB storage per year",
      "fontSize": 20.245528514139384,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Non functionl requirements\n     -  CAP theorem : \n          - Consistency while Booking the ticket seat, payment etc  \n             Ex- Same seat cannot be booked by multiple user.\n          - Available for Search, View the events. \n\n       - Back of the envelop assumptions\n            1. DAU - 100 M\n            2. 1% of DAU book per day- 1 M \n            3.  Read Actions Per User(searching, viewing) - 10 \n            4.  Seat Lock :  5 Mins\n            5.  Peak factor: 10x avg \n            6.  QPS: \n                  - read : 100M users* 10 actions =  1 B read per day = 1B/10^5 seconds =  10K qps\n                                Peak 10x average read=  100Kqps\n                   - write: 1M /Day = 10QPS \n                                 Peak 10x average=  100QPS\n                    there for  read:write=  1000:1 \n             7. Storage :\n                   =  1M* booking table(1000 bytes)  = 1M*1000 bytes /day\n                    = 365 * 10^6 *10^3 bytes peryear = 365GB storage per year",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
