      "version": 155,
      "seed": 392514382,
      "id": "ff7nhtzoynyAiQiH9JYrL",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1472.1937751933967,
      "y": 4134.567741761699,
      "width": 380.3369140625,
      "height": 220,
      "index": "b4M",
      "roundness": null,
      "versionNonce": 1857308666,
      "text": "1. Event N:N Venue -> link carries time+screen\n   -> becomes entity: Show\n2. Seat = chair. ShowSeat = chair for ONE show.\n   Status lives on ShowSeat, never on Seat.\n3. Redis absorbs 8K QPS burst.\n   DB conditional UPDATE is the truth (AP != money).\n4. Kafka only AFTER confirm. Booking API is sync.\n5. Unhappy paths: lock expiry job, payment fail ->\n   release, payment timeout -> webhook + reconcile,\n   double click -> Idempotency-Key.\n6. Burst: waiting room (Redis token) before Booking.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Event N:N Venue -> link carries time+screen\n   -> becomes entity: Show\n2. Seat = chair. ShowSeat = chair for ONE show.\n   Status lives on ShowSeat, never on Seat.\n3. Redis absorbs 8K QPS burst.\n   DB conditional UPDATE is the truth (AP != money).\n4. Kafka only AFTER confirm. Booking API is sync.\n5. Unhappy paths: lock expiry job, payment fail ->\n   release, payment timeout -> webhook + reconcile,\n   double click -> Idempotency-Key.\n6. Burst: waiting room (Redis token) before Booking.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
