      "updated": 1786352493177,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "version": 7,
      "id": "ljTzqS3pzllip_xaxi9ur",
      "index": "b60",
      "seed": 482423674,
      "versionNonce": 804499622,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 225.33058287038557,
      "y": 6044.270082175328,
      "width": 171.36,
      "height": 22.5,
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "Key points to say",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Key points to say",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786352493177,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "version": 7,
      "id": "3_5lYCDC4MrswqF8sSFHB",
      "index": "b61",
      "seed": 604025914,
      "versionNonce": 1054446778,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 225.33058287038557,
      "y": 6081.270082175328,
      "width": 364.00000000000006,
      "height": 227.5,
      "roundness": null,
      "text": "1. Event N:N Venue. Link carries time + screen,\n   so it becomes an entity: Show.\n2. Seat + ShowSeat merged into Ticket (1 row per\n   seat per show). Costs ~5 GB/day, kills a join.\n3. Show stays separate: time/price shared by all\n   200 tickets. Reschedule = 1 row, not 200.\n4. Redis absorbs the 8K QPS burst, but the DB\n   conditional UPDATE is the truth. AP != money.\n5. Waiting Room, not Kafka, in front of Booking.\n   Booking API is sync — user waits for the seat.\n6. Kafka only AFTER confirm (notify/analytics).\n7. Unhappy paths: lock expiry job, payment fail ->\n   release, timeout -> webhook + reconcile job,\n   double click -> Idempotency-Key.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Event N:N Venue. Link carries time + screen,\n   so it becomes an entity: Show.\n2. Seat + ShowSeat merged into Ticket (1 row per\n   seat per show). Costs ~5 GB/day, kills a join.\n3. Show stays separate: time/price shared by all\n   200 tickets. Reschedule = 1 row, not 200.\n4. Redis absorbs the 8K QPS burst, but the DB\n   conditional UPDATE is the truth. AP != money.\n5. Waiting Room, not Kafka, in front of Booking.\n   Booking API is sync — user waits for the seat.\n6. Kafka only AFTER confirm (notify/analytics).\n7. Unhappy paths: lock expiry job, payment fail ->\n   release, timeout -> webhook + reconcile job,\n   double click -> Idempotency-Key.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
