      "locked": false,
      "text": "4  SEAT MAP\n   GET /v1/shows/{showId}/seats\n   200  { showId, screen,\n          seats:[{ticketId,row,num,type,price,status}] }\n   status = AVAILABLE | HELD | SOLD      lazy expiry applied\n   no cache\n\n5  RESERVE  (lock, 5 min)\n   POST /v1/bookings\n   hdr  Authorization: Bearer <jwt>       userId from token, never body\n        Idempotency-Key: <uuid>\n   body { showId, ticketIds:[\"T6\",\"T7\"] }\n   201  { bookingId, status:\"PENDING\", amount, expiresAt }\n   409  { error:\"SEATS_TAKEN\", takenIds:[\"T7\"] }\n\n6  CONFIRM  (after payment)\n   POST /v1/bookings/{bookingId}/confirm\n   hdr  Idempotency-Key\n   body { paymentToken }\n   200  { bookingId, status:\"CONFIRMED\", tickets:[...] }\n   410  { error:\"LOCK_EXPIRED\" }\n\n7  RELEASE  (user backs out)\n   DELETE /v1/bookings/{bookingId}\n   204\n\n8  MY BOOKINGS\n   GET /v1/bookings?status=CONFIRMED\n   200  [ { bookingId, showId, seats, amount, status } ]",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4  SEAT MAP\n   GET /v1/shows/{showId}/seats\n   200  { showId, screen,\n          seats:[{ticketId,row,num,type,price,status}] }\n   status = AVAILABLE | HELD | SOLD      lazy expiry applied\n   no cache\n\n5  RESERVE  (lock, 5 min)\n   POST /v1/bookings\n   hdr  Authorization: Bearer <jwt>       userId from token, never body\n        Idempotency-Key: <uuid>\n   body { showId, ticketIds:[\"T6\",\"T7\"] }\n   201  { bookingId, status:\"PENDING\", amount, expiresAt }\n   409  { error:\"SEATS_TAKEN\", takenIds:[\"T7\"] }\n\n6  CONFIRM  (after payment)\n   POST /v1/bookings/{bookingId}/confirm\n   hdr  Idempotency-Key\n   body { paymentToken }\n   200  { bookingId, status:\"CONFIRMED\", tickets:[...] }\n   410  { error:\"LOCK_EXPIRED\" }\n\n7  RELEASE  (user backs out)\n   DELETE /v1/bookings/{bookingId}\n   204\n\n8  MY BOOKINGS\n   GET /v1/bookings?status=CONFIRMED\n   200  [ { bookingId, showId, seats, amount, status } ]",
